Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] broadcom/vulkan: build the v3dv ICD as an archive on
 Phoenix

Phoenix-RTOS has no Vulkan loader and no usable dlopen() for a driver
(libphoenix is not PIC; its dlopen resolves no TLS relocations), so a
Vulkan program links the ICD statically and calls its loader-interface
entry point vk_icdGetInstanceProcAddr() where it would call the
loader's vkGetInstanceProcAddr() (the same pattern as patch 0002 for the
GL stack).

libvulkan_broadcom becomes library(), which follows default_library:
unchanged for the usual default_library=shared, an archive with the
Phoenix cross file's default_library=static. meson bundles the internal
static libraries it links (Vulkan runtime + WSI incl. VK_KHR_display,
Vulkan util, NIR, SPIR-V, the broadcom compiler) into the installed
archive. The ICD version script (vulkan_icd_link_args) does not apply
to an archive; nothing else changes.
---
 src/broadcom/vulkan/meson.build | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/broadcom/vulkan/meson.build b/src/broadcom/vulkan/meson.build
--- a/src/broadcom/vulkan/meson.build
+++ b/src/broadcom/vulkan/meson.build
@@ -115,7 +115,11 @@
 )
 endforeach
 
-libvulkan_broadcom = shared_library(
+# Phoenix-RTOS links programs statically (no Vulkan loader, no dlopen of an
+# ICD): library() follows default_library, so the Phoenix cross file's
+# default_library=static makes the ICD an archive that a program links and
+# calls through vk_icdGetInstanceProcAddr. Unchanged for default_library=shared.
+libvulkan_broadcom = library(
   'vulkan_broadcom',
   [libv3dv_files, v3dv_entrypoints, v3dv_drirc, sha1_h],
   include_directories : [
